WEBVTT

00:07:58.349 --> 00:08:02.102
and a necessary step to nurturing
the future of these industries.

00:08:02.102 --> 00:08:06.732
This is the future that will not only
change the fabric of these institutions,

00:08:06.732 --> 00:08:10.402
but ensure they survive
and prosper for years to come.

00:08:11.487 --> 00:08:14.990
And as more and more children
are connected to the opportunities

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:19.286
and knowledge and resources
that they need to chase their dreams,

00:08:19.328 --> 00:08:22.331
I'm excited to see the people
that lead every industry

00:08:22.373 --> 00:08:24.667
look a lot more
like the world around them.

00:08:24.708 --> 00:08:27.044
I know this transformation can happen,

00:08:27.086 --> 00:08:29.004
but I can't do it alone.

00:08:29.046 --> 00:08:31.298
So if you have an idea or interest